# Hide Lineage — prop overrides applied by features/hide_lineage.sh
# Format: key=value, one per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# (ro.crypto.state, ro.build.tags, ro.build.type) — those are skipped or
# already covered elsewhere in JerryManager's own apply_boot_props(). Left
# empty deliberately rather than guessing actual ro.lineage.* values, since
# a wrong prop value here fails silently at boot. Populate with real
# ro.lineage.* / ro.build.* overrides for your device's actual props if you
# want this feature to do anything.
#
# Example (do not uncomment blindly — verify against `getprop` on YOUR device):
# ro.lineage.version=
# ro.lineage.build.version=
